        "Description": "Doctor Katashi Ito is a morgue doctor at GAMA, but he has a dark secret - he runs an organ trafficking ring that is used to supply organs to the hospital. Many have died as a result of him, and your objective is to kill him. The client has offered to pay a bonus if he is killed with a scalpel - a tool he has used many times while organ trafficking.",
